[statement]
Reduced from postmarketOS v26.06 over Alpine v3.24 (`main` and
`community`, 2026-11-11), asked for `postmarketos-ui-plasma-mobile`;
postmarketOS's repository first. `alsa-plugins-pulse` is needed by
`postmarketos-base-ui-audio-backend-pulseaudio`, and its condition,
`pulseaudio-alsa !pipewire`, does not hold, `pipewire` being installed.
apk installs it just before the package needing it, after `plasma-mobile`,
where ferrata installs it with `libpulse`, before `libcanberra-pulse`,
whose condition holds: placing `pulseaudio-alsa` does not trigger it,
since its condition's `!pipewire` forbids `pipewire`, placed already
(`install-order/a-condition-a-package-reached-forbids-is-not-walked-there`).

